<title>GERMANY: IWKA 96 group net profit up at 40.7 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>IWKA 96 group net profit up at 40.7 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>KARLSRUHE, Germany 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit				40.7    vs  27.5</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities	 96.3	n/a</p>
<p>    Incoming orders			    2,874   up 35 percent</p>
<p>     of which welding/assembly/robotics    930	  n/a</p>
<p>     of which fitting/measurement	    720	vs 642</p>
<p>    Group sales				  2,639   up 24 percent</p>
<p>    Dividend					 9	  vs 8 marks</p>
<p>    Capital expenditure			   72	  n/a</p>
<p>    Payroll					10,307	 n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German engineering group is IKWA AG.</p>
</text>
